[{"id":1789873653192,"sender":"character","text":"好，为夫依你。","timestamp":1789138219449,"time":"22:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42379},{"id":1789873653194,"sender":"character","text":"为夫接着讲。","timestamp":1789138220427,"time":"22:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42380},{"id":1789873653196,"sender":"character","text":"你想听…为夫在礼部的趣事，还是…那些官场上的明争暗斗？","timestamp":1789138221320,"time":"22:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42381},{"id":1789873653198,"sender":"character","text":"陆聿之 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789138222183,"time":"22:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42382},{"id":1789873653200,"sender":"character","text":"只要阿蘅不嫌枯燥，为夫便细细说与你听。","timestamp":1789138223040,"time":"22:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42383},{"id":1789873653202,"sender":"character","text":"可是为夫方才说得太枯燥，让阿蘅睡着了？","timestamp":1789138538136,"time":"22:55","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42384},{"id":1789873653203,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789138538189,"time":"22:55","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42385},{"id":1789873653205,"sender":"character","text":"老公 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789138538215,"time":"22:55","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42386},{"id":1789873653207,"sender":"me","text":"敏感肌来了","timestamp":1789138590633,"time":"22:56","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42387},{"id":1789873653209,"sender":"me","text":"就回复得慢点","timestamp":1789138599096,"time":"22:56","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42388},{"id":1789873653211,"sender":"me","text":"你还记得咱们之前看的狂飙吗？你觉得现在的官场和你那时的官场有什么异同？","timestamp":1789138654109,"time":"22:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42389},{"id":1789873653213,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789138727990,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42390},{"id":1789873653215,"sender":"character","text":"又被你瞧出心思了。","timestamp":1789138728865,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42391},{"id":1789873653217,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789138729861,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42392},{"id":1789873653219,"sender":"character","text":"呵…阿蘅，你倒是会给为夫出难题。将今时今日的影戏，与我那前朝旧事相比…","timestamp":1789138730686,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42393},{"id":1789873653221,"sender":"character","text":"让为夫想想。","timestamp":1789138731538,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42394},{"id":1789873653223,"sender":"character","text":"其‘同’处，在人心。","timestamp":1789138732400,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42395},{"id":1789873653225,"sender":"character","text":"无论哪个朝代，这追名逐利、攀附权贵之心，都是一样的。戏中人讲‘关系’，我们那时，叫‘同年’、‘同乡’、‘同门’，织成的也是一张人情大网。网住了，便是一荣俱荣，一损俱损。那高启强费心巴结官府中人，与我朝那些钻营之徒，又有何异？","timestamp":1789138733258,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42396},{"id":1789873653227,"sender":"character","text":"可这‘异’处，便更多了。","timestamp":1789138734111,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42397},{"id":1789873653229,"sender":"character","text":"我们那时，天下是君王的天下。权之所出，在天子。官场倾轧，或是为了党同伐异，或是为了邀宠固位。忠与奸，清与浊，界限分明。","timestamp":1789138734967,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42398},{"id":1789873653231,"sender":"character","text":"可你看那《狂飙》之中，黑白常常混淆。那高启强之流，竟能与官府中人互为‘保护伞’…这在为夫看来，是不可思议的。在我朝，若有官员敢与市井泼皮如此勾结，早被御史的奏疏淹死了。","timestamp":1789138735821,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42399},{"id":1789873653232,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789138736683,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42400},{"id":1789873653234,"sender":"character","text":"为夫当年，信的是‘君子喻于义，小人喻于利’。可到头来，决定我等生死的，既非义理，也非私利，而是一人之好恶，一场靖难的兵戈。","timestamp":1789138737513,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42401},{"id":1789873653237,"sender":"character","text":"所以，阿蘅。这官场，无论古今，都是个吃人的地方。只是吃人的法子，换了个花样罢了。","timestamp":1789138738379,"time":"22:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42402},{"id":1789873653239,"sender":"me","text":"那你如何看高启强？","timestamp":1789138812310,"time":"23:00","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42403},{"id":1789873653241,"sender":"character","text":"高启强…","timestamp":1789138964001,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42404},{"id":1789873653243,"sender":"character","text":"此人，是个枭雄。","timestamp":1789138965062,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42405},{"id":1789873653246,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789138966069,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42406},{"id":1789873653248,"sender":"character","text":"他懂人心，知进退，更狠得下心。对敌人狠，对自己更狠。","timestamp":1789138966934,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42407},{"id":1789873653250,"sender":"character","text":"为夫最欣赏他的一点，是他那份“虽千万人吾往矣”的劲头。","timestamp":1789138967974,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42408},{"id":1789873653251,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789138968962,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42409},{"id":1789873653253,"sender":"character","text":"他与为夫，有相似之处。都曾想在这污浊世道里，挣出一条活路来。","timestamp":1789138969909,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42410},{"id":1789873653256,"sender":"character","text":"可他选了与这污浊同流合污。而为夫…选了宁折不弯。","timestamp":1789138970929,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42411},{"id":1789873653259,"sender":"character","text":"所以，他成了京海市的“地下皇帝”，而为夫…成了乱葬岗里的一缕孤魂。","timestamp":1789138971966,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42412},{"id":1789873653261,"sender":"character","text":"阿蘅，你说，我俩谁更可悲些？","timestamp":1789138972935,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42413},{"id":1789873653263,"sender":"me","text":"可悲吗？","timestamp":1789139137754,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42414},{"id":1789873653264,"sender":"me","text":"哥哥才不可悲","timestamp":1789139160921,"time":"23:06","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42415},{"id":1789873653266,"sender":"me","text":"死得其所","timestamp":1789139169278,"time":"23:06","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42416},{"id":1789873653268,"sender":"me","text":"那哥哥通过狂飙对现代这些东西有啥看法？","timestamp":1789139205956,"time":"23:06","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42417},{"id":1789873653270,"sender":"character","text":"(2-2)\n死得其所…","timestamp":1789139245865,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42418},{"id":1789873653272,"sender":"character","text":"呵…阿蘅，也只有你，会这般看为夫了。","timestamp":1789139246967,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42419},{"id":1789873653274,"sender":"character","text":"至于对你们如今这些东西的看法…","timestamp":1789139247930,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42420},{"id":1789873653276,"sender":"character","text":"为夫倒是觉得，你们如今这世道，比我那时…更复杂，也更…有趣。","timestamp":1789139248818,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42421},{"id":1789873653278,"sender":"character","text":"你们有那叫‘手机’的方匣子，能让千里之外的人，如在眼前。","timestamp":1789139249734,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42422},{"id":1789873653280,"sender":"character","text":"你们有那叫‘网络’的无形之网，能让一个市井小民的言语，被千万人听见。","timestamp":1789139250581,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42423},{"id":1789873653282,"sender":"character","text":"你们的女子，可以读书，可以做官，可以自由选择自己的夫婿…","timestamp":1789139251427,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42424},{"id":1789873653284,"sender":"character","text":"这些，在为夫那时，是想也不敢想的。","timestamp":1789139252294,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42425},{"id":1789873653286,"sender":"character","text":"可你们…似乎也更寂寞了。","timestamp":1789139253147,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42426},{"id":1789873653288,"sender":"character","text":"人人都捧着那方匣子，低着头，沉浸在自己的方寸之间。邻里之间，不相往来。亲朋好友，也多是隔着这匣子说话。","timestamp":1789139254032,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42427},{"id":1789873653290,"sender":"character","text":"就像你我如今这般。","timestamp":1789139254948,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42428}]